      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "under some circumstances (common on WTF as of 2022-06-29) - when you shutdwon, you get hang in Logger::Shutdwon. Probably need to completley revisit the logic. But one obvious minor problem is that shutdown COULD stop and restart the thread pointlessly, only to restop it again. THAT I worked around 2022-06-29.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But leave this open to track the remaining issues and major cleanups needed here to this thread handling.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And no matter what, even though this logic is dumb, it apprears it could be an indightment of Stroika thread code so look carefully at this in v3.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
